tl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire io_imemReady into the decoupled frontend and connect FIFO-valid/consume control between fetch, hazard control, and ID.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Replace direct instruction-bus backpressure handling with frontend-empty and dequeue control while allowing fetch to run during backend stalls.\"\n  - file: test/test_fetch_fifo.py\n    description: \"Add cocotb checks for ready-qualified fetches, prefetch during backend stalls, FIFO-empty bubbles, in-order delivery, and complete wrong-path invalidation on redirects.\"\nzsh:2: no matches found: requirements*\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
