{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"agent_message","text":"The prior structural slot has already exhausted frontend FIFO, global divider interlock, raw load bypass, store buffering, late store forwarding, and half-cycle writeback. I’m narrowing this round to a topology change that attacks the likely multiplier timing boundary without reintroducing those high-fanout or memory-port paths."}}
