and pending target. Reconstruct replay PCs as\\n{12'b0, tag, 2'b00}; alignment and the enforced instruction-address range make\\nthis representation exact rather than probabilistic. Keep both branch-PC and\\ntarget equality, the existing accepted-fetch fill protocol, and the registered\\nPC-only io_imemAddr path unchanged.\\n\\nNarrowing four address registers and both hit/fill comparisons should reduce\\nflip-flop count, equality-reduction depth, and local routing while preserving\\nthe replay buffer's measured CoreMark cycle savings. This avoids the failed\\napproaches of adding entries, removing an exact comparison, or introducing a\\nspeculative target mux on the instruction-fetch timing cone.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 2, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/branch_target_buffer.sv\", \"description\": \"Compress all resident and pending branch/target addresses to aligned 18-bit word tags, reconstruct the full replay PC with zero upper bits, and retain the existing two-tag hit condition and stall-safe fill sequencing.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed checks for compressed-tag hit and miss behavior, boundary addresses within the 1 MiB executable range, distinct word addresses, cold fill, repeated replay, and fill/replay alignment under bus stalls.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 2, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/branch_target_buffer.sv\", \"description\": \"Compress all resident and pending branch/target addresses to aligned 18-bit word tags, reconstruct the full replay PC with zero upper bits, and retain the existing two-tag hit condition and stall-safe fill sequencing.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed checks for compressed-tag hit and miss behavior, boundary addresses within the 1 MiB executable range, distinct word addresses, cold fill, repeated replay, and fill/replay alignment under bus stalls.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 416.43, \"delta_pct\": -3.58, \"vs_baseline\": 47.24, \"fmax_mhz\": 176.83, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4246355, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 10689, \"ff\": 1997, \"seeds\": [171.5, 176.83, 177.87], \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T16:49:36.586577Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 6, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-07-11 hyp-20260711-003-r6s2 (regression, -3.58%): Compressing exact replay-buffer PCs to PC[19:2] can still regress when local upper-bit and alignment guards replace the removed 32-bit equality work, so range compression only pays if address validity is enforced once upstream rather than requalified on the hit/fill paths.\"}\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"id\",\"title\",\"category\",\"motivation\",\"hypothesis\",\"expected_impact\",\"changes\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\":       {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^hyp-[0-9]{8}-[0-9]{3}(-r[0-9]+s[0-9]+)?$\"},\n    \"title\":    {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 5},\n    \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"micro_opt\",\"structural\",\"extension\",\"predictor\",\"memory\"]},\n    \"motivation\":  {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 20},\n    \"hypothesis\":  {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 20},\n    \"expected_impact\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"fitness_delta_pct\",\"confidence\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"fitness_delta_pct\": {\"type\": \"integer\"},\n        \"confidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"low\",\"medium\",\"high\"]}\n      }\n    },\n    \"changes\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"file\",\"description\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"file\":        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Must be under rtl/ (any extension) or be a test/test_*.py cocotb suite. Anything else is rejected by the runtime sandbox check.\",\n            \"pattern\": \"^(rtl/[^.].*|test/test_[^/]+\\\\.py)$\"\n          },\n          \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r4s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r2s0.last\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r6s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r4s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r4s2.last\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r6s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r6s2.last\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r2s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r2s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r5s1.last\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r5s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r7s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r2s2.last\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r4s0.last\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r5s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r1s1.last\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r7s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r3s1.last\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r3s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r6s0.last\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r1s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r3s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r1s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r5s2.last\ncore