-045-r17s2\tRegistered Lookahead Agree Branch Predictor\tregression\t340.84\t-32.59\t115.73\t3395390\nhyp-20260428-048-r18s2\tKill-Gated I-Fetch Replay Fills\tregression\t337.32\t-36.28\t116.69\t3459314\nhyp-20260428-051-r19s2\tXOR-Indexed I-Fetch Replay Predictor\tregression\t522.1\t-1.37\t180.64\t3459875\nhyp-20260428-054-r20s2\tBanked Registered I-Fetch Replay Predictor\timprovement\t577.76\t9.15\t198.69\t3438981\nhyp-20260428-057-r21s2\tSkewed-Bank I-Fetch Replay Predictor\tregression\t457.76\t-20.77\t157.6\t3442835\nhyp-20260428-060-r22s2\tStream-Resistant Replay Insertion\tregression\t390.36\t-32.44\t136.18\t3488613\nhyp-20260428-063-r23s2\tLow-Bit Static Target Alignment Predictor\tregression\t490.61\t-15.08\t168.72\t3438981\nhyp-20260428-066-r24s2\tRegistered Lookahead JALR Target Predictor\tregression\t154.53\t-73.25\t52.99\t3429014\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
